ُتَرَبِّصِينَ","N","stem","ACT|PCPL|(V)|MP|GEN"]]},{"e":"٣١","v":"52:31"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"52:15","t":"Then is this magic, or do you not see?","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"52:16","t":"[Enter to] burn therein; then be patient or impatient - it is all the same for you. You are only being recompensed [for] what you used to do.\"","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"52:17","t":"Indeed, the righteous will be in gardens and pleasure,","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"52:18","t":"Enjoying what their Lord has given them, and their Lord protected them from the punishment of Hellfire.","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"52:19","t":"[They will be told], \"Eat and drink in satisfaction for what you used to do.\"","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"52:20","t":"They will be reclining on thrones lined up, and We will marry them to fair women with large, [beautiful] eyes.","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"52:21","t":"And those who believed and whose descendants followed them in faith - We will join with them their descendants, and We will not deprive them of anything of their deeds. Every person, for what he earned, is retained.","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"52:22","t":"And We will provide them with fruit and meat from whatever they desire.","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"52:23","t":"They will exchange with one another a cup [of wine] wherein [results] no ill speech or commission of sin.","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"52:24","t":"There will circulate among them [servant] boys [especially] for them, as if they were pearls well-protected.","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"52:25","t":"And they will approach one another, inquiring of each other.","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"52:26","t":"They will say, \"Indeed, we were previously among our people fearful [of displeasing Allāh].","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"52:27","t":"So Allāh conferred favor upon us and protected us from the punishment of the Scorching Fire.","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"52:28","t":"Indeed, we used to supplicate Him before. Indeed, it is He who is the Beneficent, the Merciful.\"","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"52:29","t":"So remind, [O Muḥammad], for you are not, by the favor of your Lord, a soothsayer or a madman.","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"52:30","t":"Or do they say [of you], \"A poet for whom we await a misfortune of time\"?","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"52:31","t":"Say, \"Wait, for indeed I am, with you, among the waiters.\"","j":27,"h":53,"s":52,"a":31,"sd":null}],"juz":27,"hizb":53,"surahs":[52],"sajdah":false}